<title>USA: U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean major sales activity in the week ended Sept 26 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:  1996/97		     1997/98</p>
<p>Japan	 181,800			   Nil</p>
<p>Unknown     113,800</p>
<p>Taiwan	104,800</p>
<p>Mexico	 85,500</p>
<p>France	 85,000</p>
<p>Net sales of 795,100 tonnes exceeded the prior week volumeby nearly one-half.</p>
<p>Exports of 385,100 tonnes were 67 percent above the previous week and 46 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Japan, Germany, Belgium, Taiwan and South Korea.</p>
</text>
